OL,5,GUK Weather Forecast                    
OL,7,GThis Evening and Tonight:FLow cloud    
OL,8,Fand patchy rain linger through the     
OL,9,Fspine of Great Britain, with clear     
OL,10,Fspells in the northwest leading to an  
OL,11,Fearly overnight frost here. Heavy rain 
OL,12,Farrives in the south in the early      
OL,13,Fhours where it will feel milder.       
OL,15,GSaturday:FA wet day for most, with     
OL,16,Fbands of heavy rain sweeping up        
OL,17,Fthrough the UK, strong winds over high 
OL,18,Fground and near coasts, with gales in  
OL,19,Fthe northeast. Feeling milder.         
